# Record work for ledger updates

When a task finishes or stops, leave a record the user can copy into the master ledger:

- Completed work
- Blockers
- Remaining tasks

Keep the record factual and limited to this task. Do not edit the ledger, and do not mark an item complete, unless the user asked for that update and the acceptance criteria are met.
